<Slide notes={`背景有了，接下来给每个地点一个正式地址。在「世界」左侧的四层地址树里，用父节点旁的「＋」逐层创建子节点：World 下建 Sector，Sector 下建 Arena，Arena 下建 Game Object。

两个常见错误要避开：一是跳层级，直接在 World 下面挂对象；二是只在图片上写一个房间名，就认为系统已经知道它的地址。名字写在图上是给人看的，地址写在树里才是给系统用的。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 640, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 22 }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>3　　3.3.3</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>建立四层地址树</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF' }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7, width: 900 }}>在图片上写一个房间名，不等于系统已经知道它的地址。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#276FBF' }}>World</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#276FBF' }}>Sector</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 64, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#276FBF' }}>Arena</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 64, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#26816B' }}>Game Object</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.3 从图像到四层空间</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>11 / 25</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
